      "standard_id": "RRID:SCR_016196",
      "name": "Neuroscience Information Exchange Format (NIX)",
      "description": "A data model and associated on-disk file format for storing fully annotated neuroscience datasets (data together with metadata). NIX defines entities (DataArray, Tags, Dimensions, Groups, etc.), supports time series, spike trains, images and ROI/event annotations, integrates odML for metadata, specifies an HDF5-backed file schema and a versioned API/file-format scheme, and provides reference libraries (C++, Python, Java, Matlab) and tools for reading/writing and viewing NIX files."
    }
